<html>
            <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #333;">
                <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 20px;">
                            <p>Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</p>

                            <p>I hope you’re doing well! I wanted to reach out because we’ve recently made some fantastic updates to our calls product that I think you’ll be excited about.</p>

                            <p>Given your previous experience with it, I believe these enhancements could significantly improve your results and overall satisfaction. I’d love to discuss how these updates can better meet your needs and support your goals.</p>

                            <p>Can we schedule a time to chat? You can easily pick a time that works for you using my scheduling link here: <a href="{!User.Salesforce_Meeting_Link__c}" style="color: #2E86C1; text-decoration: none;">Schedule a Meeting</a>.</p>

                            <p>Looking forward to reconnecting!</p>

                            <p>Best regards,</p>
                            <p>{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}<br/>
                            {!User.Title}<br/>
                            {!User.Phone}</p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </body>
        </html>